# 🔐 Web3 Wallet

A lightweight Web3 Wallet interface built using **React (TypeScript)**, **Vite**, **Tailwind CSS**, and **Web3.js**. This project enables users to connect their Ethereum wallet (like MetaMask), check their wallet address, and interact with the Ethereum blockchain.

---

## 🚀 Features

- ⚛️ Built with React + TypeScript + Vite
- 🎨 Styled using Tailwind CSS
- 🌐 Connect Ethereum wallet (e.g., MetaMask)
- 💼 Display connected wallet address
- 🔐 Secure and minimal wallet interface

---

## 📦 Tech Stack

- [React](https://reactjs.org/)
- [TypeScript](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)
- [Vite](https://vitejs.dev/)
- [Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)

